Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:03.50,Han,,0,0,0,,早上好 今天天气还不错\N{\rEN}Good morning. Nice weather today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:05.00,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}便利店 二十四小时营业 欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:06.50,Han,,0,0,0,,我就随便说说 你别当真\N{\rEN}I'm just saying, don't take it seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:11.00,Han,,0,0,0,,这个周末如果不下雨的话我们就去河边骑车\N然后在草地上野餐好不好\N{\rEN}If it doesn't rain this weekend, let's ride along the river and have a picnic on the grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:15.50,Han,,0,0,0,,我刚刚看了一下 明天早上七点半出发应\N该来得及 不过今晚要早点睡\N{\rEN}I just checked. If we leave at 7:30 tomorrow morning we'll make it,\Nbut we should sleep early tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:18.00,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}第二天早上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:21.00,Han,,0,0,0,,闹钟响了三次 我才终于爬起来\N{\rEN}The alarm went off three times before I finally got up.
